config UNISOC_MODEM_POWER_MANAGER
	tristate "UNISOC Modem Power Manager"
	depends on PM_SLEEP
	default n
	help
	  This driver provide modem and sp driver to apply/get/release wakelock
	  when module business started.
	  Also it be user for modem power management.

	  Say M here to enable power_manager support in GKI projects, also you
	  can set Y in none-GKI projects.
